{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2008,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x+1}{e^x}\\), determina la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en su punto de inflexión.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Escribo \\(f(x)=(x+1)e^{-x}\\):</p>\\[f'(x)=e^{-x}-(x+1)e^{-x}=-xe^{-x},\\qquad f''(x)=-e^{-x}+xe^{-x}=(x-1)e^{-x}=0\\iff x=1\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M51.0 40Q67.0 4 83.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M133.0 12Q149.0 48 165.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f''\\) cambia de signo en \\(x=1\\): inflexión en \\(\\left(1,\\frac2e\\right)\\). Pendiente: \\(f'(1)=-\\frac1e\\).</p>\\[y-\\frac2e=-\\frac1e(x-1)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=\\dfrac{3-x}e\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas mediante \\(f(x)=x^3-4x\\) y \\(g(x)=3x-6\\).","apartados":["(0,75 p.) Determina los puntos de corte de las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\).","(1,75 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por dichas gráficas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[x^3-4x=3x-6\\iff x^3-7x+6=0\\]<p>\\(x=1\\) es raíz; por Ruffini, \\(x^3-7x+6=(x-1)(x^2+x-6)=(x-1)(x-2)(x+3)\\).</p><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((-3,-15)\\), \\((1,-3)\\) y \\((2,0)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En \\((-3,1)\\) va por encima \\(f\\) (en \\(x=0\\): \\(0\\gt-6\\)); en \\((1,2)\\), \\(g\\) (en \\(x=1{,}5\\): \\(-1{,}5\\gt-2{,}625\\)).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 240' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='51.5,204.0 53.5,195.0 55.5,186.3 57.4,178.0 59.4,170.0 61.4,162.4 63.3,155.1 65.3,148.1 67.3,141.4 69.2,135.1 71.2,129.0 73.2,123.2 75.2,117.8 77.1,112.6 79.1,107.7 81.1,103.1 83.0,98.8 85.0,94.7 87.0,90.9 88.9,87.3 90.9,84.0 92.9,80.9 94.8,78.1 96.8,75.5 98.8,73.1 100.8,70.9 102.7,68.9 104.7,67.1 106.7,65.6 108.6,64.2 110.6,63.0 112.6,62.0 114.5,61.2 116.5,60.5 118.5,60.0 120.5,59.6 122.4,59.4 124.4,59.4 126.4,59.4 128.3,59.7 130.3,60.0 132.3,60.5 134.2,61.0 136.2,61.7 138.2,62.5 140.2,63.4 142.1,64.3 144.1,65.4 146.1,66.5 148.0,67.7 150.0,69.0 152.0,70.3 153.9,71.7 155.9,73.1 157.9,74.6 159.8,76.1 161.8,77.7 163.8,79.2 165.8,80.8 167.7,82.4 169.7,84.0 171.7,85.6 173.6,87.2 175.6,88.8 177.6,90.3 179.5,91.9 181.5,93.4 183.5,94.9 185.5,96.3 187.4,97.7 189.4,99.0 191.4,100.3 193.3,101.5 195.3,102.6 